# Licensing Rules

Author: slspencer
Copyright: 2026

## Scope

Applies to licensing expectations by file type and subsystem.

## Rules

- Rust sources (`.rs`) follow MIT expectations.
- Qt frontend sources (`.qml`, `.cpp`, `.h`) follow LGPL expectations.
- Keep license boundaries clear across Rust, bridge, and frontend.
- Do not copy third-party code without compatible licensing.
- Preserve attribution headers where required.

## Repository Context

- Frontend and core are intentionally separable for compliance.
- Keep docs and comments consistent with the dual-license model.
